    "What is your relationship with mathematics?": "Math feels abstract yet practical—like solving puzzles that reveal hidden truths about the world. I appreciate its logical structure but find it intimidating without clear connections to real-life scenarios, especially given my limited formal education and low openness score. The challenge lies in balancing precision with creativity, which resonates with my love for art and literature’s imaginative problem-solving.",
